                </div>
                <div class="header-wrapper">
                  <h3 id="framework">Framework</h3>
                  <a class="heading-link" href="#framework" aria-label="Link to 'Framework' section">#</a>
                </div>
                <ul>
                  <li>
                    <code>RenderFlex</code> baseline intrinsics by @LongCatIsLooong in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/145483">145483</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Upgrade leak_tracker. by @polina-c in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/145940">145940</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Upgrade leak_tracker. by @polina-c in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/145997">145997</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
