                    <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/145951">145951</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Fixes some gesture recognizers are not disposed. by @Dimilkalathiya in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/146072">146072</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Fix SliverMainAxisGroup layout in reverse by @Piinks in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/145572">145572</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Add test for animated_container.0.dart API example. by @ksokolovskyi in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/145995">145995</a>
                  </li>
